Read the entire monograph as an advanced theoretical progression, working the derivations and checking the original evidence and competing interpretations for the chosen research question. Compare thermodynamic, diffusional, nucleation, and crystallographic models with measured transformation behavior rather than treating a fitted curve as a mechanism.

